e, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR - Castle Guardian", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Shooter", "id": "3744040075834813"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Strategy", "id": "275629210202852"}], "release_date": 1791300600, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1336697632863077", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1336697619529745", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1804388830603763"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1778900369928377", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "5_KaraArslan_Bow.png", "id": "28907608558877555", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_28907608568877554_2525311325083086409_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qznfT7lHO0Q7kNvwH8wpBo&_nc_oc=AdpLGLBJm_HAA0uDiAXqOxOKdt7TpZJLKc2iubELBcXXMzJFh_jC7v4NIk05VJlltWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXSuminyN1d4t676W0EBllUCEc-DFxOSlUGV4zaYx4kdA&oe=6B105048"}, {"file_name": "3_Ladders.png", "id": "2910512375974181", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2910512389307513_4955520990640300480_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t3X_n0RQ0fcQ7kNvwFsYqDr&_nc_oc=AdooFNOKRia5QPOtH2zp7bBEpaFeJYr3agpO7jZb5fAKCwmNlhJtWqNX1ZKWbyf-yRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW0RifXNpYRqPAaCgcZpZXEL0LHqYpkgJdiXytxRh4Zjw&oe=6B1069AB"}, {"file_name": "1_Wave_Bow.png", "id": "1128016283337756", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1128016286671089_7063843350158977864_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PHqyyZh_Jb0Q7kNvwGW_ly8&_nc_oc=Ado9R8HWjDQp5HfyyTuvrz1x8jZjW_bVtuskqqfV0gtnYnWfwpg2Q_B8S_6uYRqGA7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU5zmAlXHp6oTK9DLlHuIysIngt8OYDPuerUnX0QE2bPQ&oe=6B105335"}, {"file_name": "2_River_Bridge.png", "id": "1773860053845285", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827960_1773860057178618_8738452438273855785_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hsWQ2-83xOAQ7kNvwFD1Urr&_nc_oc=AdoFTksAhtSWZFJDLJIQoMNxg5HxqfW1PPAyjNpZqmGnfwuQ4VdHXpFyZNbDL5tpO_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWjFilSX8WjO5bgxMq4hvCpwgqLNOiBumzJzfq_7y7CvA&oe=6B103D5A"}, {"file_name": "4_Warlord.png", "id": "1763032414900862", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1763032421567528_352465577248756467_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=42wYwMn6d9MQ7kNvwHMLLnO&_nc_oc=AdrmUmiFoxaWnINfBEbDhteo49HOgOGBUNbD0FPNjiUE9v-5ie3ZwrxV1vrj2ub_-pE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUpdvGrwE8mzpyR4Ncsio7cmdEYpQ-vldY9Ov1On0AdYA&oe=6B10652A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR - Castle Guardian", "keywords": ["ok\u00e7uluk", "kalesavunmas\u0131", "ku\u015fatma", "sel\u00e7uklu", "yay"], "long_description": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR, Sel\u00e7uklu esintili bir kale savunma oyunu. Kap\u0131n\u0131n \u00fcst\u00fcndeki n\u00f6bet yerindesin: elinde yay, \u00f6n\u00fcnde surlara k\u0131vr\u0131lan yol ve o yolda dalga dalga gelen d\u00fc\u015fman.\n\n\u2022 11 b\u00f6l\u00fcml\u00fck sefer: Kale Kap\u0131s\u0131, Nehir Ge\u00e7idi, Da\u011f Ge\u00e7idi, Gece Bask\u0131n\u0131, Kervansaray, G\u00f6zetleme Vadisi, Son Ku\u015fatma, Harabe Yolu, Nehir Liman\u0131, B\u00fcy\u00fck Zafer ve Kara Arslan'a kar\u015f\u0131 son direni\u015f. G\u00fcnd\u00fcz, ak\u015fam, kapal\u0131 hava ve gece.\n\u2022 Her d\u00fc\u015fman\u0131n bir i\u015fi var: ak\u0131nc\u0131lar, cirit\u00e7iler, balyozcular, kalkan duvarlar\u0131, askerlerini h\u0131zland\u0131ran sancaktarlar, surlara t\u0131rmanan merdivenliler, ko\u00e7ba\u015f\u0131 ekipleri, z\u0131rhl\u0131 \u015fampiyonlar ve hepsinin ba\u015f\u0131 Kara Arslan.\n\u2022 \u00d6zel oklar: ate\u015f, buz ve bomba. Odak dolunca a\u011f\u0131r \u00e7ekim ve \u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ok.\n\u2022 Kalenin tuzaklar\u0131: zift kazan\u0131, barut f\u0131\u00e7\u0131lar\u0131, k\u00fct\u00fck tuza\u011f\u0131, ar\u0131 kovan\u0131 ve kap\u0131y\u0131 onaran gong.\n\u2022 Dalgalar aras\u0131nda g\u00fc\u00e7 kart\u0131n\u0131 okla vurarak se\u00e7. \u0130lerledik\u00e7e 5 yay ve 5 ok a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r. R\u00fczg\u00e2r okunu yana iter.\n\u2022 Ger\u00e7ek bir yay: istedi\u011fin elle tut, kiri\u015fi \u00e7ekerken gerilimi kumandada hisset.\n\u2022 Deneme Sahas\u0131: b\u00fct\u00fcn \u00f6zel oklar, tuzaklar ve ku\u015fatma d\u00fc\u015fmanlar\u0131 bir arada.\n\u2022 Yerinde durarak oynan\u0131r, y\u00fcr\u00fcmek yok; kademeli d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f var. Tek oyunculu, internet gerekmez. T\u00fcrk\u00e7e ve \u0130ngilizce.", "short_description": "Surlar\u0131n \u00fcst\u00fcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na bir ok\u00e7usun. Kiri\u015fi T\u00fcrk usul\u00fc ba\u015fparmakla \u00e7ek, kap\u0131na y\u00fcr\u00fcyen orduyu durdur! Kalkan duvarlar\u0131n\u0131 ate\u015f okuyla par\u00e7ala, surlara dayanan merdivenleri devir, ko\u00e7ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131r, zift kazan\u0131n\u0131 bo\u015falt. R\u00fczg\u00e2r\u0131 hesaba kat, dalgalar aras\u0131nda g\u00fc\u00e7 kart\u0131n\u0131 vur, yay\u0131n\u0131 ve okunu se\u00e7. 11 b\u00f6l\u00fcml\u00fck seferin sonunda seni Kara Arslan bekliyor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "28450152117986564", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_28450152124653230_5164661097279647223_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8G2qAGhzD4gQ7kNvwEKYzHf&_nc_oc=AdrgFdFeJsu81IXvkBTSZes1J46YRGs5dxCU_waKeFuQXtr37fjS8iDta_-rqV2q8qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV3E0wNTl96IqThep8nsRDppF8Of7vFw6w27aNRsaNQtA&oe=6B1045B8"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440.png", "id": "4531183330504456", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_4531183337171122_4171532996689135983_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rp3fA0y_m34Q7kNvwHUxi_9&_nc_oc=Adr1d0Vv8xR9hzH_jq5oulgquAVQskY0wAipmvd6cSh_mnYVmd187yE_rFfgAXTRfOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXYmtpdL4uHBgEAbJnf3S2Ea0QgtM2BWayQ4eOMItCZig&oe=6B1044F8"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1931486241153063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1931486244486396_897634452790904240_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W2P5znhPxdcQ7kNvwFNo-iG&_nc_oc=Adp9jb87FfmahkDPtt574E7GYDSY4m8dfhPIc-VjO55hM53WeX0_ErimUEInwUX1Sko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWlBz7XS8aiVuxNzRLm-a3VIdM85U7wQjS-uOGvalTiEg&oe=6B1036A6"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1657089075986734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827611_1657089079320067_1668155353679474096_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4O-RCKyXGYQ7kNvwGN3e5k&_nc_oc=AdrHEm1eJZCg0xWxDLW0ITHcgFe7rWtJLG7dvT3U2cmmck9No9nPnsNH8bTOhzQ63wc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVWfTtxK1Lu302QitrqmAC5cJGz_YkVBUFUoivwM698wA&oe=6B105E69"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Hero_3000x900.png", "id": "1632337235225576", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1632337238558909_8868986481535757527_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KWWSJTwuDk0Q7kNvwFKDsOZ&_nc_oc=AdopOwxOT13ESZ2JTPrJIeM7Cl2vfGEyLtoWVn5n5J6B32-uC7dksfDanJmLYn-UMmc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUixN621p6_6yNortkN3rjw6iRNZ7qMnWuvksaTa0UbxQ&oe=6B10662F"}]}, "id": "1633674428478091", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "5_KaraArslan_Bow.png", "id": "4074430666183075", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_4074430669516408_3979608834263180895_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6fnwp2FKRAUQ7kNvwE720Ee&_nc_oc=AdpzG75O-iaRB4eQ98h8WWaVhygLjWYcdxBnfxZODg5njPKScLdr1gPY_ROE9BOwXjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW5jzRPYBo1lL4XOq1iVnMOLxQJyFVrqq8MogfmWEf7gg&oe=6B1040D4"}, {"file_name": "3_Ladders.png", "id": "1493990555883920", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1493990559217253_7629746177234797997_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XrAusP08wIAQ7kNvwG41v35&_nc_oc=AdqcNn3YpSNbFrjsUDbzdKZOyr6ehfCT2IZ4JDD1hwY5aH2173PxEys6D3iOMs-jSSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXe2eDnnwPc0la5ffYsv5WhCsq6YGX93c8sKGAiI5NQng&oe=6B105C76"}, {"file_name": "1_Wave_Bow.png", "id": "1417221733859354", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825481_1417221737192687_7911887793521602782_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MXlW9Vtw4sgQ7kNvwH3oZuA&_nc_oc=Adon7TanomIR9UA8qwKhIH0WdZqAmrvgtCQqwaobl363u3m5dw6vh_Qm2kzrlTDud_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVVq95UJD6mfFGVIRIMdjq12d-BLvoLv2AazUnpp8OMHw&oe=6B105C8D"}, {"file_name": "2_River_Bridge.png", "id": "2083618996360002", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_2083618999693335_5747791748849489698_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EK11VP5ZShEQ7kNvwHxtTj-&_nc_oc=AdozLfewgZj0j5uxFMQGQUFfkDOTKwpZjVCk7nWZ91ALstG5XUV6ZycyVtwnBde97f4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU8TBlC9BVkmbBnQLvnHX0FWMbGGKMSmupVwwn8O50XBg&oe=6B106797"}, {"file_name": "4_Warlord.png", "id": "28533472169645183", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_28533472196311847_2155285360544025034_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EBCtaZ8gM8oQ7kNvwHC5fZq&_nc_oc=AdpNOYV2uGTk8f7fzNEaj1GdM91rLzEcIl7B2us-CroVQE-uBXTFH6Gk5Z4DOafeVyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXVEZIJO5VF1lQ_c_pXEPWZ_2rvCpYz3-70O7voU6dunQ&oe=6B106769"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1499713912181331", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1499713918847997_6161723442624004798_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qa2Xz4d7lqEQ7kNvwE5y6LR&_nc_oc=Adp2x2IHUvN8OSajsZ_YQoBJkcCBieLpRzJVWjTKoortybAJmyj79rZMtX965ekMiSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWnlpjL6RWAmbDOycJSdowxS0zJqu40EaVagRun1GfADw&oe=6B103995"}, "display_name": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR - Castle Guardian", "keywords": ["archery", "castledefense", "siege", "towerdefense", "bow"], "long_description": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR (Castle Guardian) is a castle defense game inspired by the Seljuks. You stand at the post above the gate, bow in hand, the road winding up to your walls and wave after wave of soldiers on it.\n\n\u2022 An 11-level campaign: Castle Gate, River Crossing, Mountain Pass, Night Raid, Caravanserai, Watch Valley, The Great Siege, Ruins Approach, River Port, Grand Victory and the final stand against Kara Arslan. Day, dusk, overcast and night.\n\u2022 Every enemy has a job: raiders, javelin throwers, sledgehammer men, shield walls, standard bearers who rally their troops, ladder bearers who climb your walls, battering ram crews, armored warlords and their leader, Kara Arslan.\n\u2022 Special arrows: fire, ice and bomb. When your focus is full: slow motion and a triple volley.\n\u2022 Castle traps: the pitch cauldron, powder kegs, a log trap, a beehive and a gong that repairs the gate.\n\u2022 Shoot a power-up card between waves. Unlock 5 bows and 5 arrows as you advance. The wind pushes your arrows aside.\n\u2022 A real bow: hold it in either hand and feel the tension in the controller as you draw.\n\u2022 Trial Arena: every special arrow, trap and siege enemy at once.\n\u2022 Played standing in place, no walking; snap turn. Single player, no internet needed. English and Turkish.", "short_description": "You are the lone archer on the ramparts. Draw your bow with a Turkish thumb draw and stop the army marching on your gate! Shatter shield walls with fire arrows, topple the ladders thrown against your walls, break the battering ram and pour the pitch cauldron. Read the wind, shoot a power-up card between waves and choose your bow and arrows. At the end of an 11-level campaign, Kara Arslan awaits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/kalemuhafzvrcastleguardian/ana-sayfa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DorukTech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/doruktechvr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "reco